# Source layout

Where things live in this repo. Commands read this to find routes, consumers, schema, tests and copy, so keep it
current when folders move. One row per area; paths are globs relative to the repo root. Delete the example row once
you add real ones.

| Area | Paths | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| API routes | `server/routes/**` | Example only: the HTTP handlers |

